    "sub": "Nutrition, training and recovery, driven by real data — not guesswork.",
    "footerHtml": "Data from Apple Health, Strava and your own plan and training program. Figures are for guidance only — not medical advice. For clinical questions, consult a professional.",
    "notes": {
      "dia.footnote": "Example cutting plan. Replace these foods, targets and notes with your own plan, then run <code>npm run generate</code>.",
      "tablas.desayunos": "Pick the breakfast that fits the day. Target ~35–40 g protein. The protein anchor options live in the <button class=\"lnk\" onclick=\"jump('acc-anclaje')\">🥛 Protein anchor</button> table.",
      "tablas.carboComida": "Rice and pasta per 100 g dry. Pasta shape does not matter: same dry weight = same macros.",
      "tablas.carboCena": "Potato and the like per 100 g cooked/ready to eat.",
      "tablas.proteina": "Meat and fish per 100 g raw. Lean every day; leave the red for treats.",
      "tablas.anclaje": "Quick options for the rest day. The light yogurt does NOT count as protein.",
      "tablas.postentreno": "The shake already carries its carb (banana); the cold cuts go with 1 slice of toast. Timing is not critical.",
      "tablas.fruta": "As dessert or with the meal. Per medium piece (a typical weight, not a label).",
      "tablas.postre": "For lunch and dinner. Fruit is the lightest; the yogurt with nuts and honey is the richest. The light yogurt does NOT count as protein.",
      "tablas.verduras": "Eat them almost freely in a cut — they fill you up and add little. Standard reference values, per 100 g.",
      "tablas.quesos": "They add fat/salt → count them, they are not \"free\".",
      "tablas.supplements": "<div class=\"meal\">\n    <div class=\"supp\"><span class=\"when\">Lunch</span><div class=\"what\">Creatine monohydrate<small>3 g, with water</small></div></div>\n    <div class=\"supp\"><span class=\"when\">Dinner</span><div class=\"what\">Magnesium<small>follow product dosage · may support sleep</small></div></div>\n    <div class=\"supp\"><span class=\"when\">Workout</span><div class=\"what\">Electrolytes<small>on hot days / long sessions</small></div></div>\n  </div>"
